- Follow WordPress JavaScript and CSS coding standards.
- Use build tools to bundle, minify, and version assets.
- Implement cache busting by appending file versions to enqueued assets.
- Test front-end code for cross-browser compatibility.

## Examples

```js
// Example: Enqueue versioned JS asset in PHP
defined('ABSPATH') || exit;
wp_enqueue_script(
    'my-plugin-main',
    plugins_url('assets/js/main.min.js', __FILE__),
    array('jquery'),
    '1.2.3', // version for cache busting
    true
);
```

```css
/* Example: CSS file header */
/*
Theme Name: My Theme
Description: Custom styles for My Theme
Version: 1.0.0
*/
```

